{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16223240","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16223240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1622324001:0":{"text":"おかえり！どう、見つかった？僕のステラファントム……無事なんだよね？","source_cn":"你们回来了！找到它了吗？我的幻灵星游……它没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA475A77E9B342D12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::0":{"text":"湖ガニ","source_cn":"湖蟹","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA4F1CF6E9A8B215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1622324002:0":{"text":"こ、これは……カニ？確かに魚だったけど……まさかこいつに食べられたとか！？","source_cn":"这……这是……一只螃蟹？我的幻灵星游呢？它明明是一条鱼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96C7E515C076A422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1622324002":{"text":"こ、これは……カニ？確かに魚だったけど……まさかこいつに食べられたとか！？","source_cn":"这……这是……一只螃蟹？我的幻灵星游呢？它明明是一条鱼！难道被这家伙吃了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96C7E515C076A422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1622324003:0":{"text":"なるほど……そういうことか！","source_cn":"原来如此……原来如此！我就知道那本《古代炼金术精要》的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0420388190F33095","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1622324004:0":{"text":"『古代錬金術の真髄』の著者には、星涙エッセンスを大量に使う勇気がなかった。","source_cn":"他肯定只敢用一滴来做实验，所以只观察到了鳞片像星光一样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69266860E229A7EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622324005:0":{"text":"だから、鱗が星のようにきらめく初期現象しか観察できなかったんだ！","source_cn":"他绝对没有胆量用一整瓶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F77DCBA32A59EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1622324006:0":{"text":"彼は知らなかった……星涙エッセンスを極限まで作用させると、水生生物が新たな魔力バランスを求めて、これほどの激しい変異を起こすことを！","source_cn":"所以他根本不知道，在星泪精华的极限催化下，水生生物为了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D3F2B1B36ECF7C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1622324007:0":{"text":"こ、これは……錬金術と生物変形学が交差した奇跡そのものだ！","source_cn":"这……这简直是炼金术与生物变形学的交叉奇迹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78234B22C52FC13C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1622324008:0":{"text":"星涙エッセンスが魚類の生命形態の変遷に及ぼす革命的影響を、まさに証明したと言える！","source_cn":"论星泪精华对鱼类生命形态迁跃的革命性影响！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A2EA90A5F96EB32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat